457
00:17:58,733 --> 00:17:59,833
Goofy guy.

458
00:17:59,833 --> 00:18:01,833
Goofy funny wacky scene.

459
00:18:01,833 --> 00:18:02,667
Funny guy.

460
00:18:05,367 --> 00:18:06,733
Goofy guy.

461
00:18:06,733 --> 00:18:08,867
Funny goofy, funny see.

462
00:18:08,867 --> 00:18:10,133
(laughs)

463
00:18:10,133 --> 00:18:11,100
Goofy, funny, see.

464
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,267
